          begin: Alignment.topLeft,
          end: Alignment.bottomRight,
          colors: [Color(0xFF2C5F7A), Color(0xFF1A3D52)],
        ),
        borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(25),
        border: Border.all(color: const Color(0x66FFFFFF), width: 1.5),
